      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `summarize_text.py` that calls a hosted LLM to summarize long text, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I'll use the Amazon Bedrock service, which provides access to various LLMs. The code will import the necessary SDK and use a specific model identifier to make the provider identifiable. </thinking>\n",
